.TH MOUSE_DOWN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
mouse_down \- True while the mouse button is held
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqinput.h\(dq
.BI "bool mouse_down(const Input *in, MouseButton b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True while the mouse button is held. Position is in\->mouse_x / in\->mouse_y in logical pixels.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/input.h)
